msgstr ""
"Ekiragiro kino bwe kibanga kikola ku fayiro ezisukka mu emu nga buli emu ebigirimu\n"
"kibiteeka mu kulumu yabyo, tekikkiriza ate kolumu ezo kuzikyusa ebyandizibaddemu\n"
"bigende kyabugazi."

